| sirius_c2_lstm384_refS | 4×384 BiLSTM, cache2, low-LR refine | 0.18237 | 0.072 | full-data fine-tune |
| antares_lstm_c2_512_ft | 4×512 BiLSTM, cache2, refine | 0.18937 | 0.065 | full-data retrain |
